    "free_text": "Rapid response to IV methylprednisolone. Outpatient flare (ferritin 8807 ng/mL) during steroid taper; tocilizumab initiated. Ferritin normalized to 98.7 ng/mL at 2 weeks, CRP <0.6. No MAS/HLH at any point. Clinically stable on tocilizumab + methotrexate + hydroxychloroquine at last follow-up."
  },
